      en: ["The house was constructed in the early 20th century in central Nassau.", "It was built using solid Bahamian limestone and native yellow pine.", "Hermann Gruber was a prominent German merchant who settled in the islands.", "The building originally functioned as a general store and a family home.", "It features traditional jalousie windows designed for tropical air circulation.", "The structure is part of the designated historical heritage of downtown Nassau."],
