      en: ["The bunker was constructed during the Second World War (1939-1945).", "Reinforced concrete was the primary material used for these defenses.", "The Bahamas served as a training ground for Allied air and sea forces.", "German U-boats were active in Caribbean waters until 1944.", "The structure housed surveillance equipment and military personnel.", "The ruin is strategically positioned near major deep-water shipping lanes."],
